              <description>It is a data buffer with 8-bit width FIFO. If accessing in word data byte, it would read/write 4 entries of FIFO.
SPIC will set SSIENR.SPIC_EN=1 automatically if user continues to push DR when DR is full in user write mode.</description>
              <bitRange>[31:0]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
          </fields>
