00: Antsel_en always disable, 01:Antsel_en field follow ctrl info 1X:Antsel_en always enable</description>
              <bitRange>[24:23]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>BIT_ANTSEL_SEL</name>
